  "meta": {
    "name": "Glitch Tracker",
    "createdAt": "2026-10-09T00:00:00.000Z",
    "modifiedAt": "2026-10-09T00:00:00.000Z"
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "glt_c",
      "defType": "meta/comment",
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": -344
      },
      "params": {
        "text": "Glitch tracker\n\nA video pipeline without a camera. 1 · Footage: five textured discs dance on Lissajous paths (the Dance subpatch) over a dotted field. 2 · Tracking: Rasterize turns each frame into pixels and Point Tracker follows the discs by optical flow alone, never seeing the motion numbers; a HUD boxes each track (colour = confidence) and joins them with Connect Points. 3 · Glitch: the footage you see goes through Echo's slit-scan (each row from a different moment), then chromatic aberration and noise displacement that burst now and then.\n\n• Press and hold on the canvas: re-seed the trackers on a grid round the cursor; let go and they follow whatever is there.\n• Slider into `glitch`: how hard the bursts hit.  • Toggle: slit-scan on / off.",
        "width": 560,
        "height": 280
      },
      "portValues": {
        "text": "Glitch tracker\n\nA video pipeline without a camera. 1 · Footage: five textured discs dance on Lissajous paths (the Dance subpatch) over a dotted field. 2 · Tracking: Rasterize turns each frame into pixels and Point Tracker follows the discs by optical flow alone, never seeing the motion numbers; a HUD boxes each track (colour = confidence) and joins them with Connect Points. 3 · Glitch: the footage you see goes through Echo's slit-scan (each row from a different moment), then chromatic aberration and noise displacement that burst now and then.\n\n• Press and hold on the canvas: re-seed the trackers on a grid round the cursor; let go and they follow whatever is there.\n• Slider into `glitch`: how hard the bursts hit.  • Toggle: slit-scan on / off.",
        "width": 560,
        "height": 280
      }
    },
